// 450_450_GeneralsOnline.str (multi-language)
// Generals Online strings in the other text languages, one 'XX: "text"' line per language
// (Patch104p's codes: DE FR ES IT KO ZH BP PL RU AR; ZH is traditional Chinese, AR is in
// logical order). The English text stays in Localization/English/; a label without a line
// for a language shows the English one. str2csf --column compiles each language into
// Data/Languages/<code>/450_450_GeneralsOnline.csf in the embedded archive.
//
// These are MACHINE TRANSLATIONS, not yet reviewed by native speakers. Corrections from the
// community are welcome; keep each label's placeholders (%d, %s) as they are.

GUI:GONoMapsForFilter
DE: "Keine Karten für diese Spielerzahl"
FR: "Aucune carte pour ce nombre de joueurs"
ES: "No hay mapas para este número de jugadores"
IT: "Nessuna mappa per questo numero di giocatori"
KO: "이 인원에 맞는 맵이 없습니다"
ZH: "沒有適合此玩家人數的地圖"
BP: "Nenhum mapa para este número de jogadores"
PL: "Brak map dla tej liczby graczy"
RU: "Нет карт для такого числа игроков"
AR: "لا توجد خرائط لهذا العدد من اللاعبين"
END

GUI:GONoGames
DE: "Noch keine Spiele in diesem Raum"
FR: "Aucune partie dans ce salon pour l'instant"
